VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'sent a colored hemisphere that turned out very well. So, there is a better outcome to strive for. I haven\'t factored in all the variables yet, and it\'s probably a matter of surface area or orientation, but I'

[09:42] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'wanted to show this to give you an idea of ​​the current state of this technology. This is similar to how we had to study the effect of suction during resin printing. And I think it\'s obvious that the resin still wins. In fact,'

[09:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'it absolutely dominates in clarity. The value of this technology is undoubtedly the color, because even with certain defects, color changes how our eyes perceive the entire model. So, miniatures. I started with the'

