VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'sniper priest from Trench Crusade, because I always print him in my resin printer reviews, and used the simple "make it grim dark" prompt in Meshy to color him. And, to be honest , I\'m pretty impressed. Everything looks clear, and the'

