VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'I could have drawn." Or: “I hate drawing at all. " Just give me this in color." And whatever your preferences, yes, you are both right. It\'s a matter of taste. But now at least we all know better what to expect. Honestly, I think that'

[13:34] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
