VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'more than for the average amateur, unless you are a very wealthy enthusiast. Of course, the fact that the technology is still in its early stages of development does not excuse all the problems. For example, there is still a lot of work to be done on the'

[18:00] [scene:talk]
